Newsletter macro only runs in one direction.

@KeithMcCullough doesn't do one-way macro.

When the U.S. Dollar signals change, he changes.

The S&P 500 is deep in negative gamma.

@t1alpha’s Gamma Volatility Throttle sits at -21, which means options dealers are adding to market moves, not absorbing them.

